oleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2253121298,"text":"We have largely confirmed a few locations with the aid of her deductions.","nextNodeIds":[400320105]},{"nodeId":400320105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2986979650,"text":"At the moment, it appears that one of the camps is guarded by our \"Hat Dog.\" This location requires greater care.","nextNodeIds":[400320106]},{"nodeId":400320106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3540466978,"text":"That was a very Paimonial nickname...","nextNodeIds":[400320107]},{"nodeId":400320107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1354366122,"text":"Hey now! Paimon wouldn't come up with such lame nicknames! If it were up to Paimon...","nextNodeIds":[400320108]},{"nodeId":400320108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3605461514,"text":"This dog would be called \"Blade Pup!\"","nextNodeIds":[400320109]},{"nodeId":400320109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":1954812506,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[400320110]},{"nodeId":400320110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2258707610,"text":"I have placed similar devices around that location. Hopefully, they'll have the same effect as before.","nextNodeIds":[400320111]},{"nodeId":400320111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2174040898,"text":"Hey! Don't ignore Paimon!","nextNodeIds":[400320112]},{"nodeId":400320112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":1122625322,"text":"I'll leave the rest in your hands.","nextNodeIds":[400320113]},{"nodeId":400320113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":1294191594,"text":"Any other questions?","nextNodeIds":[400320114]},{"nodeId":400320114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":114888018,"text":"Can we count on this intel?","nextNodeIds":[400320115]},{"nodeId":400320115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":741558298,"text":"Most certainly. I did scout the areas out myself.","nextNodeIds":[400320116]},{"nodeId":400320116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":475978826,"text":"Why aren't you coming with us this time, Ryuuji?","nextNodeIds":[400320117]},{"nodeId":400320117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":259052042,"text":"I would have, if not for a certain other task that I must perform for Sango.","nextNodeIds":[400320118]},{"nodeId":400320118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":3281775698,"text":"Broadly, she has some ideas as to the source of our \"Hat Dog,\" and has asked that I investigate the matter.","nextNodeIds":[400320119]},{"nodeId":400320119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3108779378,"text":"It's \"Blade Pup\"!","nextNodeIds":[400320120]},{"nodeId":400320120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2888914418,"text":"\"Hat Dog.\"","nextNodeIds":[400320121,400320124]},{"nodeId":400320121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":805976034,"text":"\"Hat Blade Pup.\"","nextNodeIds":[400320122]},{"nodeId":400320122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":1221599282,"text":"That combination doesn't work.","nextNodeIds":[400320123]},{"nodeId":400320123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":914658362,"text":"What sort of nickname is that, anyway!?","nextNodeIds":[400320125]},{"nodeId":400320125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2151222234,"text":"Hmm. Perhaps we should just return to calling it \"Black Shadow.\"","nextNodeIds":[400320126]},{"nodeId":400320126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2216542978,"text":"Whatever the case, I leave the animals to you.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":400320124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3005673474,"text":"C'mon, less fighting...","nextNodeIds":[400320125]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4003201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3042"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4003202,"order":3,"stepDescription":"Go to the investigation site and perform the rescue","stepDescTextMapHash":1482877356,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"133221068_finish"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOM